    "detailed_description": "<strong>Wintersdawn in the Deep is an easygoing, snackable adventure game based on the acclaimed all-ages fantasy webcomic <i>Beyond the Western Deep</i>.</strong><br><br>For the people of Sunsgrove, the annual Wintersdawn festival is a time to come together and celebrate their past accomplishments. For Quinlan, a newly-minted scout of the kingdom, it's his one chance to partake in food and fun, and to forget the past year's trials.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197130/extras/8de378c2ea52fade71fb37d08b2ebbff.poster.avif?t=1670000733\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197130/extras/8de378c2ea52fade71fb37d08b2ebbff.webm?t=1670000733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197130/extras/8de378c2ea52fade71fb37d08b2ebbff.mp4?t=1670000733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Unfortunately for Quinlan, events conspire to send him into the wilds of the Western Deep: an untamed forest filled with the kingdom's deadliest creatures.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197130/extras/a42d972b73f2571d1165be0be960a46d.poster.avif?t=1670000733\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197130/extras/a42d972b73f2571d1165be0be960a46d.webm?t=1670000733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197130/extras/a42d972b73f2571d1165be0be960a46d.mp4?t=1670000733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Before he can return home, Quinlan must successfully complete his very first solo patrol, uncover the fate of a lost merchant, and survive the dangers hiding within the Western Deep.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197130/extras/14e3ec457d7d6c2d41d8bf43568c63fa.poster.avif?t=1670000733\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197130/extras/14e3ec457d7d6c2d41d8bf43568c63fa.webm?t=1670000733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197130/extras/14e3ec457d7d6c2d41d8bf43568c63fa.mp4?t=1670000733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Needless to say, this year's Wintersdawn festival will be anything but ordinary.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197130/extras/4a640d4ec10083103f91bf61ccc5dbdf.poster.avif?t=1670000733\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197130/extras/4a640d4ec10083103f91bf61ccc5dbdf.webm?t=1670000733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197130/extras/4a640d4ec10083103f91bf61ccc5dbdf.mp4?t=1670000733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">- A self-contained &quot;adventure short story&quot; inspired by the dark fantasy worlds of 80's animation and the vibrant pixel art of late-80's EGA PC adventures!</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">- Simple point-and-click interface with a drag-and-drop inventory system.</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">- An original, fully orchestral soundtrack.</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">- An unlockable collection of over 20 pieces of bonus and concept artwork chronicling the history of <i>Beyond the Western Deep</i>.</ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Wintersdawn in the Deep is an easygoing, snackable adventure game based on the acclaimed all-ages fantasy webcomic <i>Beyond the Western Deep</i>.</strong><br><br>For the people of Sunsgrove, the annual Wintersdawn festival is a time to come together and celebrate their past accomplishments. For Quinlan, a newly-minted scout of the kingdom, it's his one chance to partake in food and fun, and to forget the past year's trials.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197130/extras/8de378c2ea52fade71fb37d08b2ebbff.poster.avif?t=1670000733\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197130/extras/8de378c2ea52fade71fb37d08b2ebbff.webm?t=1670000733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197130/extras/8de378c2ea52fade71fb37d08b2ebbff.mp4?t=1670000733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Unfortunately for Quinlan, events conspire to send him into the wilds of the Western Deep: an untamed forest filled with the kingdom's deadliest creatures.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197130/extras/a42d972b73f2571d1165be0be960a46d.poster.avif?t=1670000733\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197130/extras/a42d972b73f2571d1165be0be960a46d.webm?t=1670000733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197130/extras/a42d972b73f2571d1165be0be960a46d.mp4?t=1670000733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Before he can return home, Quinlan must successfully complete his very first solo patrol, uncover the fate of a lost merchant, and survive the dangers hiding within the Western Deep.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197130/extras/14e3ec457d7d6c2d41d8bf43568c63fa.poster.avif?t=1670000733\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197130/extras/14e3ec457d7d6c2d41d8bf43568c63fa.webm?t=1670000733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197130/extras/14e3ec457d7d6c2d41d8bf43568c63fa.mp4?t=1670000733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Needless to say, this year's Wintersdawn festival will be anything but ordinary.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197130/extras/4a640d4ec10083103f91bf61ccc5dbdf.poster.avif?t=1670000733\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197130/extras/4a640d4ec10083103f91bf61ccc5dbdf.webm?t=1670000733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197130/extras/4a640d4ec10083103f91bf61ccc5dbdf.mp4?t=1670000733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">- A self-contained &quot;adventure short story&quot; inspired by the dark fantasy worlds of 80's animation and the vibrant pixel art of late-80's EGA PC adventures!</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">- Simple point-and-click interface with a drag-and-drop inventory system.</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">- An original, fully orchestral soundtrack.</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">- An unlockable collection of over 20 pieces of bonus and concept artwork chronicling the history of <i>Beyond the Western Deep</i>.</ul>",
